# ISC-DHCP-RELAY

> [!NOTE]
> You have to have the third iso attached to install this package without internet.

It will prompt for every configuration you need after installing the package, in order:

```bash
apt install isc-dhcp-relay
```

1. Which server to forward frames?
2. Which interfaces to listen on? Space sperated list! (List the interface where you will forward and where you receive packets)
3. Extra options

If you have to edit these settings, you can find them in `/etc/default/isc-dhcp-relay`.
